From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 07:51:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: the shell may bind a tap of a modifier alone

A shell could bind chords only, so tapping Super could not open an
overview the way it does on GNOME and KDE (mecattaf, #2007).

- `StartModifierTaps` (`chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_modifier_taps.cc`)
  observes aura's keys, clicks, scrolls, pinches and touches and tells
  `DeskModifierTaps` (`components/domicile/browser/desk_modifier_taps.h`),
  which hands a tap to the shell page that grabbed it.
- Started in `PostBrowserStart`, beside `StartPointerHiding`.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`.
---
 chrome/browser/chrome_browser_main.cc | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_main.cc b/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_main.cc
index 542d51e..9940644 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_main.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_main.cc
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_desk_activity.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_desk_pointer.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_file_dialogs.h"
+#include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_modifier_taps.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_pointer_hiding.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_shell_windows.h"
 #include "components/domicile/browser/desktop_prefs.h"
@@ -1832,6 +1833,10 @@ void ChromeBrowserMainParts::PostBrowserStart() {
   // as the desk's config says. Here for the same reason.
   domicile::StartPointerHiding();
 
+  // Domicile's engine fork: hears a tap of Super alone, which the shell can
+  // bind, as it hears every key. Here for the same reason.
+  domicile::StartModifierTaps();
+
   for (auto& chrome_extra_part : chrome_extra_parts_) {
     chrome_extra_part->PostBrowserStart();
   }
